(7035539, 1068934, 59029, '<td valign="top">good idea, execution needs a lot more work to be more convincing.  There is no sense of suddenly stopped movement on either person''s part, they''re just standing there.  No tension in the stick-holder''s arms, no effort on the cameraman''s part to dodge or block the stick.</td>', 'good idea, execution needs a lot more work to be more convincing.  There is no sense of suddenly stopped movement on either person''s part, they''re just standing there.  No tension in the stick-holder''s arms, no effort on the cameraman''s part to dodge or block the stick.', '2013-05-10 15:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
