(7036525, 1068565, 161867, '<td valign="top">Instinctively I would prefer the cutting board and chives not be cut by the left edge of the frame. But since framing that way would not be difficult, it made me question why the creative choice was made and I spent more time looking at the photo as a result (which is a good thing). I like the color scheme, the wood tones really pop nicely. My only criticism is that the photo seems a little unbalanced to me. Maybe it is the crop, but I could''ve used an element at the bottom right of the frame, maybe a stray pepper or a knife tip.</td>', 'Instinctively I would prefer the cutting board and chives not be cut by the left edge of the frame. But since framing that way would not be difficult, it made me question why the creative choice was made and I spent more time looking at the photo as a result (which is a good thing). I like the color scheme, the wood tones really pop nicely. My only criticism is that the photo seems a little unbalanced to me. Maybe it is the crop, but I could''ve used an element at the bottom right of the frame, maybe a stray pepper or a knife tip.', '2013-05-13 12:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036526, 1068931, 161867, '<td valign="top">It feels violent. Not sure if that was your intent, but it evokes emotion, which is good.</td>', 'It feels violent. Not sure if that was your intent, but it evokes emotion, which is good.', '2013-05-13 12:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036527, 1068918, 161867, '<td valign="top">A tad grainy. Looks like the ISO was set too high for such a bright day.</td>', 'A tad grainy. Looks like the ISO was set too high for such a bright day.', '2013-05-13 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036528, 1068943, 161867, '<td valign="top">Well done. Good colors. Nice bokeh. A little grainy in the corners though.</td>', 'Well done. Good colors. Nice bokeh. A little grainy in the corners though.', '2013-05-13 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036529, 1068640, 161867, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Great detail in the bird. Love the bokeh.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Great detail in the bird. Love the bokeh.', '2013-05-13 12:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036530, 1068622, 161867, '<td valign="top">Great title. I love that you are having fun with the contest. I also like the asymmetry of the drain vs the symmetry of the mayo. I might have tried to make the mayo labels more symmetrical though. And I think a lower angle would have been more interesting.</td>', 'Great title. I love that you are having fun with the contest. I also like the asymmetry of the drain vs the symmetry of the mayo. I might have tried to make the mayo labels more symmetrical though. And I think a lower angle would have been more interesting.', '2013-05-13 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036531, 1068888, 161867, '<td valign="top">Nive shot. I like the BW and the color mix. The lime seems too bright.</td>', 'Nive shot. I like the BW and the color mix. The lime seems too bright.', '2013-05-13 12:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036533, 1068843, 161867, '<td valign="top">A little too much going on. It looks like the singer is wearing two hats bc of the man behind him. Also a little grainy on the guitar. But I like the eye lines. My view travels nicely from the man in glasses to the singer and then down the mic to the cigarette. I am somewhat distracted by the girl in the right third of the frame though.</td>', 'A little too much going on. It looks like the singer is wearing two hats bc of the man behind him. Also a little grainy on the guitar. But I like the eye lines. My view travels nicely from the man in glasses to the singer and then down the mic to the cigarette. I am somewhat distracted by the girl in the right third of the frame though.', '2013-05-13 12:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036534, 1068850, 161867, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Great color and saturation that is vibrant but still natural looking.</td>', 'Fantastic. Great color and saturation that is vibrant but still natural looking.', '2013-05-13 12:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036535, 1068946, 161867, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell what the doll is holding. I am guessing a camera?</td>', 'It''s hard to tell what the doll is holding. I am guessing a camera?', '2013-05-13 12:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036537, 1068928, 161867, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo. Not sure if the guitar is really that big or edited to appear so. Either way I enjoy looking at the picture.</td>', 'Really nice photo. Not sure if the guitar is really that big or edited to appear so. Either way I enjoy looking at the picture.', '2013-05-13 12:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036539, 1068644, 161867, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of vignetting (I think it is horribly over used), but it works really well here. The only minor criticism is that the sign over the car is distracting. It commands a lot of visual weight relative to El Conductor.</td>', 'I am not a fan of vignetting (I think it is horribly over used), but it works really well here. The only minor criticism is that the sign over the car is distracting. It commands a lot of visual weight relative to El Conductor.', '2013-05-13 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036542, 1068435, 161867, '<td valign="top">Excellent food photo! looks delicious. Lots of detail. No camera in reflection. Aces</td>', 'Excellent food photo! looks delicious. Lots of detail. No camera in reflection. Aces', '2013-05-13 12:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036546, 1068935, 161867, '<td valign="top">Great title. Good photo. The model is an interesting subject. The signs in the back, esp the Customer Service one command a lot of visual weight. Not sure if that was intentional. If you shorten the depth of field it would be easier to see him say, waiting at a train station, which was the impression I got from looking at him. The signs in the back make me feel like he is at a bank.</td>', 'Great title. Good photo. The model is an interesting subject. The signs in the back, esp the Customer Service one command a lot of visual weight. Not sure if that was intentional. If you shorten the depth of field it would be easier to see him say, waiting at a train station, which was the impression I got from looking at him. The signs in the back make me feel like he is at a bank.', '2013-05-13 12:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036548, 1068947, 161867, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. A bit grainy. Not sure how it relates to the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo. A bit grainy. Not sure how it relates to the challenge.', '2013-05-13 12:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036549, 1068890, 161867, '<td valign="top">Awesome. My fave of the challenge to far. Nice balance and framing. The off center label works. I feel like I am looking at a person, with personality.</td>', 'Awesome. My fave of the challenge to far. Nice balance and framing. The off center label works. I feel like I am looking at a person, with personality.', '2013-05-13 12:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036551, 1068949, 161867, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Nice use of BW. Perfect title. I feel this mans impatience/hunger.</td>', 'Great photo. Nice use of BW. Perfect title. I feel this mans impatience/hunger.', '2013-05-13 12:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7036552, 1068948, 161867, '<td valign="top">Nice post-work. Looks like it could be a Corona ad.</td>', 'Nice post-work. Looks like it could be a Corona ad.', '2013-05-13 12:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
