(7040523, 1068640, 153814, '<td valign="top">The Red-naped Sapsucker (Sphyrapicus nuchalis) is a medium-sized <b>North American </b>woodpecker.<br/>It''s NOT a Mexican woodpecker it just happens to winter there.<br/></td>', 'The Red-naped Sapsucker (Sphyrapicus nuchalis) is a medium-sized North American woodpecker.It''s NOT a Mexican woodpecker it just happens to winter there.', '2013-05-20 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 0),
